==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The 6th Angel (Enemy)|The 6th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

